sequenceDiagram
participant A0 as Buyer
participant A1 as Checkout / Order (TD)
participant A2 as Catalog services (HP)
participant A3 as PostgreSQL
A0->>A1: Selected cart own address shipping
A1->>A2: Read server product/pricing snapshot
A1->>A2: lockAndCheck StockQuantity
A2->>A3: Locks và stock availability
A1->>A2: decrease cùng transaction
A1->>A3: Order NEW COD snapshot cleanup
A3->>A0: Commit receipt hoặc rollback